## Original Content
The 32nd Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) Small and Medium Enterprises (SME) Ministerial Meeting will be held on Sept. 4 in Guangzhou, south China's Guangdong Province, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT) said on Monday.

## Summary
The 32nd Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation Small and Medium Enterprises Ministerial Meeting is scheduled for September 4 in Guangzhou, China. The meeting will focus on innovation and cooperation among SMEs. It was announced by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology.

## Key Points
- The 32nd APEC SME Ministerial Meeting will be held on September 4.
- The location is Guangzhou, Guangdong Province, China.
- The meeting will emphasize innovation and cooperation.
- The announcement was made by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology.


